[signal arg="start"]
[end_timeline]
Oh…What? What happened to them?
join Pig center [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
Pig: "Hey, be careful. I don’t know how long until Daron comes back."
The Pig spoke in a raspy voice.
leave Pig [animation="Fade Out" length="0.3"]
join Player center [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
Player: "Daron? That makes sense, so he’s the one that kidnapped me."
leave Player [animation="Fade Out" length="0.3"]
join Cow center [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
Cow: “Help…”
The Cow spoke weakly.
leave Cow [animation="Fade Out" length="0.3"]
join Player center [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
Player: “Oh my God…How did this happen to you guys?”
leave Player [animation="Fade Out" length="0.3"]
join Pig left [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
join Cow right [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
Pig: “He did this to us, I didn’t think he’d be so sensitive over a joke that he turned us into ones…”
Cow: “Please help us, we need water…”
leave --All-- [animation="Fade Out" length="0.3"]
join Player center [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
“Water? Don’t you want to escape?”
leave --All-- [animation="Fade Out" length="0.3"]
join Pig left [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
join Cow right [animation="Fade In" length="0.3"]
The Pig shakes their head.
Pig: “I don’t want anyone to see me like this, but I do want to see Daron get what he deserves. You need to avenge us…”
Cow: “Water…Can you please get us water?”
Player: “Can you guys help me escape?”
Pig: “Only if you get us water first…”
leave --All-- [animation="Fade Out" length="0.3"]
[signal arg="activateBucket"]
[signal arg="end"]
